      "text": [
        " فِي قَوْلِ اللَّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ وَ جَعَلَنِي مُبارَكاً أَيْنَ ما كُنْتُ قَالَ نَفَّاعاً ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Sahl Bin Ziyad, from Yahya Bin Al Mubarak, from Abdullah Bin Jabala, from a man, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said regarding the Words of Allah<sup>azwj</sup> Mighty and Majestic <span class=\"ibTxt\"><a href=\"/#/books/quran:19#h31\"><a href=\"/books/quran:19#h31\">[19:31]</a></a> And He has Made me (Isa</span><sup class=\"ibTxt\">as</sup><span class=\"ibTxt\">) Blessed wherever I may be</span>: He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Beneficial (to the people)’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "11. A number of our people have narrated from Sahl ibn Ziyad from Yahya ibn al- Mubarak from ‘Abd Allah ibn Jabalah from a man from abu ‘Abd Allah (a.s.) who has said the following: “About the words of Allah, the Most Majestic, the Most Holy: ‘. . . He has blessed me no matter where I dwell, . . .’ <a href=\"/#/books/quran:19#h31\"><a href=\"/books/quran:19#h31\">[19:31]</a></a> the Imam said, ‘“Blessed” means, the most beneficial to people.’” "
        ]
      }
